  "contentHtml": "<p>저는 완두 4종을 파종했습니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>씨앗은행에서 받은 IT224153(둥근노랑), IT224149(주름초록)</p><p>마곡 씨앗도서관에서 받은 토종 보리콩(둥근초록-마르면 둥근노랑), 토종 자주완두</p><p>&#160;</p><p>씨앗은행에서 받은 것은 원산지 몽골이라고 되어 있어서 몽노, 몽초, 토노, 토자 이렇게 표기했습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e1559e57ddd3e4b03c3e97bdd4582b6cb38912dd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e1559e57ddd3e4b03c3e97bdd4582b6cb38912dd\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><p>꽃이 잎겨드랑이에서 피는지 줄기 끝에서 피는지 구분이 좀 어렵네요~ 이건 다시 자세히 봐야겠습니다~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba3e670ae2d963c7723b0d6da4a7773106e29368\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba3e670ae2d963c7723b0d6da4a7773106e29368\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"><div class=\"figcaption\">몽노 몽초</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1633b6188d83dc3549bc5d244a7fd6046ed5d040\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1633b6188d83dc3549bc5d244a7fd6046ed5d040\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"><div class=\"figcaption\">토자 토노</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>현재 확실하게 구분 가능한 형질들은 다섯개의 형질 정도네요^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a9168e7f8c52d937bff94aafdb3529a9412a24d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a9168e7f8c52d937bff94aafdb3529a9412a24d\" data-origin-width=\"871\" data-origin-height=\"251\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
